senses.gloss:
सम्-√ इ P. -एति, to go or come together, meet at (acc.) or with (instr. or dat.), encounter (as friends or enemies), RV. &c. &c.;
to come together in sexual union, cohabit (acc. or सार्धम्, सह), MBh.; R.;
to come to, arrive at, approach, visit, seek, enter upon, begin, RV. &c. &c.;
to lead to (acc.), RV. iii, 54, 5;
to consent, agree with (instr. ‘it is agreed between’, with gen. of pers. and loc. of thing), ŚBr.; MBh. :
Pass. -ईयते, to be united or met or resorted to &c.:
Intens. -ईयते, to visit, frequent, RV.;
to appear, be manifested, BhP.

समी—√ कृ P. Ā. -करोति, -कुरुते, to make even, level, KātyŚr.; R.; MārkP. &c.;
to equalize, Hcat.;
to place on an equality with, declare to be equal to (instr.), Kāvyād.;
to adjust, settle, MBh.; R.; Mn., Sch.;
to raze to the ground, annihilate, Kathās.; Jātakam.

समी—√ भू P. -भवति, to be or become equal, be equalized, MW.;
to place one's self on an equality, Āpast.;
to be razed to the ground or destroyed, Jātakam.

सम्-√ इन्ध् Ā. -इन्द्धे, or -इन्धे (once in Br. 3. pl. impf. -ऐन्धन्; cf. Nir. x, 8; Ved. inf. -इ॑धम् and -इ॑धे),
to set fire to, set alight, light up, kindle, ignite, inflame (lit. and fig.), RV.; AV.; Br.; Mn.;
to take fire, RV. vii, 8, 1;
to swell, increase, exhibit, show, betray. (skill), Bhaṭṭ. :
Pass. -इध्यते, to be kindled, take fire, break out into flame, RV.; &c.

सम्-√ ईक्ष् Ā. -ईक्षते, to look at or inspect thoroughly, investigate closely, view, perceive, see, VS. &c. &c.;
to become aware of, ascertain, R.;
to find out, contrive, invent, MBh.;
to think of, aim at, have in view, bear in mind, MBh.;
to consider well, inquire into, investigate, examine, contemplate, Mn.; MBh. &c.;
to look closely at in order to choose or destine for (two acc.), R. :
Caus. -ईक्षयति, ˚ते, to cause to look at or view or perceive, AV.; KātyŚr.;
to let one's self be seen, show one's self, appear, AV.

सम्-√ 1. मिक्ष् (or -मिमिक्ष्; cf. √ 1. मिक्ष्; only Impv. -मिमिक्ष्वा॑ and 2. du. pf. -मिमिक्ष॑थुः, but accord. to some referable to सम्- √ 1. मिह्, q.v.),
to mix with, furnish or endow with (instr.), RV. i, 48, 16;
to prepare (an oblation), ib. viii, 10, 2.

सम्-√ ईर् (only impf. ऐ॑रत्), to join together, bring about, create, RV.;
to effect, promote, ib. :
Caus. ईरयति, ˚ते, to cause to move, set in motion, impel, agitate, urge on, send forth, RV.; TBr.; Bhaṭṭ.;
to bring about, accomplish, produce, create, RV.; AV.;
to reanimate, revive, ŚBr.;
to confer, bestow, endow with, AV.; ŚBr.

सम्-√ 1. मिक्ष् (or -मिमिक्ष्; cf. √ 1. मिक्ष्; only Impv. -मिमिक्ष्वा॑ and 2. du. pf. -मिमिक्ष॑थुः, but accord. to some referable to सम्- √ 1. मिह्, q.v.),
to mix with, furnish or endow with (instr.), RV. i, 48, 16;
to prepare (an oblation), ib. viii, 10, 2.

सम्-√ मील् P. -मीलति, to shut the eyes, RV.; Br.; GṛŚrS.;
to close up (as a flower), Śak.; Suśr. :
Caus. -मीलयति (with or without नेत्रे), to close the eyes, Kālid.; Kathās.; Suśr.;
to cause to close the eyes i.e. make insensible, kill, Uttarar.; Sāh.
